          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.36,
            0.822,
            0.502
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. How has mathematics helped propel humanity forward? (You might think of examples involving: carrying out scientific experiments; running our economy and democracy; building bridges, houses or other complex structures; making TVs, mobile phones, computers, bicycles, trains, cars, planes, calendars, clocks, etc.)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.529,
            0.525,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1.2 Patterns in Numbers"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.569,
            0.885,
            0.615
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Among the most basic patterns that occur in mathematics are patterns of numbers, particularly patterns of whole numbers:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.451,
            0.621,
            0.597,
            0.643
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_1_equation_8.jpg",
          "content": "0 , 1 , 2 , 3 , 4 , \\ldots"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.65,
            0.884,
            0.694
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The branch of Mathematics that studies patterns in whole numbers is called "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "number theory",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "."
