            0.164,
            0.696,
            0.885,
            0.741
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Number sequences",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " are the most basic and among the most fascinating types of patterns that mathematicians study."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
